      "widgets_values": [
        "A portrait of the character, flawlessly preserving the original identity, facial proportions, and exact skin saturation. An ultra-sheer, faint diagonal grid pattern is applied entirely over the face like a precise translucent facial decal. The grid covers the face fully but stops exactly at the facial edges. Absolutely no grid lines exist on the character's hair, neck, outfit, or the surrounding background. The microscopic mesh is highly transparent (barely there), allowing the original beautiful eyes, expressions, and clear silhouette to shine through sharply without any distortion. The grid overlay has strictly zero impact on skin color, perfectly maintaining the original natural skin tone, lighting, and color grading without any desaturation or color shift. Photorealistic, 8k resolution."
